## NEXUS COMPLETE JOB SUMMARY

**NEXUS is a cohesive AI-assisted contract acquisition system.**

**Its complete job:**
1. **DISCOVER** opportunities (SAM.gov, RSS, local portals)
2. **SCORE & QUALIFY** using 6-criteria AI scoring
3. **CREATE** bid infrastructure (folders, checklists, tracking)
4. **FIND & VET** subcontractors (auto-sourced, USASpending checked, 6-pillar vetted)
5. **GENERATE** all documents (buyer cap statements, emails, RFQs, sub outreach)
6. **MANAGE** outreach and responses (track status, auto-remind, follow up)
7. **TRACK** to award (deadline alerts, status updates, win/loss logging)

**ONE TRIGGER. FULL EXECUTION. NO FRAGMENTATION.**
